<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Missed Call Rescue — Never Lose Another Lead</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Syne:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=DM+Sans:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..40,300;0,9..40,400;0,9..40,500;1,9..40,300&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #080c14;
    --bg2: #0d1422;
    --bg3: #111827;
    --card: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
    --card-border: rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
    --blue: #2d7ef8;
    --blue-bright: #4a9eff;
    --blue-glow: rgba(45,126,248,0.25);
    --blue-dim: rgba(45,126,248,0.12);
    --text: #f0f4ff;
    --text-muted: rgba(240,244,255,0.55);
    --text-dim: rgba(240,244,255,0.35);
    --green: #22d382;
    --radius: 16px;
    --radius-sm: 10px;
  }

  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

  body {
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }

  h1,h2,h3,h4 {
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  a { text-decoration: none; color: inherit; }

  /* ─── NOISE OVERLAY ─────────────────────────────── */
  body::before {
    content: '';
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 256 256' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='noise'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.9' numOctaves='4' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23noise)' opacity='0.04'/%3E%3C/svg%3E");
    background-size: 256px;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 0;
    opacity: 0.5;
  }

  /* ─── LAYOUT ────────────────────────────────────── */
  .container { max-width: 1120px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  section { position: relative; z-index: 1; }

  /* ─── NAV ───────────────────────────────────────── */
  nav {
    position: fixed;
    top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
    z-index: 100;
    padding: 18px 0;
    transition: background 0.3s, backdrop-filter 0.3s;
  }
  nav.scrolled {
    background: rgba(8,12,20,0.88);
    backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--card-border);
  }
  .nav-inner {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    max-width: 1120px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 24px;
  }
  .nav-logo {
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
    font-size: 19px;
    font-weight: 700;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .nav-logo .dot {
    width: 9px; height: 9px;
    background: var(--blue);
    border-radius: 50%;
    box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--blue);
    animation: pulse 2s infinite;
  }
  @keyframes pulse {
    0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
    50% { opacity: 0.5; }
  }
  .nav-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 36px;
    list-style: none;
  }
  .nav-links a {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }
  .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--text); }
  .btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 11px 22px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 500;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s;
    border: none;
  }
  .btn-primary {
    background: var(--blue);
    color: #fff;
    box-shadow: 0 0 24px var(--blue-glow);
  }
  .btn-primary:hover {
    background: var(--blue-bright);
    box-shadow: 0 0 36px rgba(74,158,255,0.4);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }
  .btn-ghost {
    background: var(--card);
    color: var(--text);
    border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
  }
  .btn-ghost:hover {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
  }
  .btn-large {
    padding: 15px 30px;
    font-size: 16px;
    border-radius: 10px;
  }
  .hamburger { display: none; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px; cursor: pointer; }
  .hamburger span { width: 22px; height: 2px; background: var(--text); border-radius: 2px; }

  /* ─── HERO ──────────────────────────────────────── */
  #hero {
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 120px 0 80px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .hero-glow {
    position: absolute;
    top: -200px; left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 900px; height: 600px;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, rgba(45,126,248,0.18) 0%, transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .hero-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 64px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .hero-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 6px 14px;
    background: var(--blue-dim);
    border: 1px solid rgba(45,126,248,0.3);
    border-radius: 100px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--blue-bright);
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .hero-badge .live-dot {
    width: 7px; height: 7px;
    background: var(--green);
    border-radius: 50%;
    animation: pulse 1.5s infinite;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(38px, 5vw, 58px);
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    color: #fff;
  }
  h1 span { color: var(--blue-bright); }
  .hero-sub {
    font-size: 18px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    max-width: 520px;
    margin-bottom: 36px;
    font-weight: 300;
  }
  .hero-btns {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }
  .hero-bullets {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .hero-bullet {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .hero-bullet .check {
    width: 20px; height: 20px;
    background: var(--blue-dim);
    border: 1px solid rgba(45,126,248,0.3);
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    color: var(--blue-bright);
    font-size: 11px;
  }

  /* ─── PHONE MOCKUP ──────────────────────────────── */
  .phone-wrap {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    position: relative;
  }
  .phone-glow-bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: -40px;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, rgba(45,126,248,0.15) 0%, transparent 65%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .phone {
    width: 280px;
    background: #0d1117;
    border-radius: 40px;
    border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    padding: 16px 12px;
    position: relative;
    box-shadow:
      0 30px 80px rgba(0,0,0,0.7),
      0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.05),
      inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
  }
  .phone-notch {
    width: 80px; height: 6px;
    background: #1c2333;
    border-radius: 3px;
    margin: 0 auto 18px;
  }
  .phone-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    padding-bottom: 14px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
  }
  .phone-contact {
    width: 40px; height: 40px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2d7ef8, #1a56c4);
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 16px;
    color: #fff;
    margin: 0 auto 8px;
  }
  .phone-name { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #fff; }
  .phone-status { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-dim); }
  .messages { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; padding: 4px 0; }
  .msg {
    max-width: 88%;
    padding: 10px 13px;
    border-radius: 16px;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    animation: msgIn 0.4s ease both;
  }
  .msg-out {
    background: var(--blue);
    color: #fff;
    align-self: flex-end;
    border-bottom-right-radius: 4px;
  }
  .msg-in {
    background: #1e2840;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    align-self: flex-start;
    border-bottom-left-radius: 4px;
  }
  .msg-time { font-size: 10px; color: var(--text-dim); margin-top: 2px; }
  .msg:nth-child(1) { animation-delay: 0.2s; }
  .msg:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.6s; }
  .msg:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 1.0s; }
  .msg:nth-child(4) { animation-delay: 1.4s; }
  .msg:nth-child(5) { animation-delay: 1.8s; }
  @keyframes msgIn {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(12px); }
    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }
  .typing-indicator {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    background: #1e2840;
    border-radius: 16px;
    border-bottom-left-radius: 4px;
    align-self: flex-start;
    animation: msgIn 0.4s ease 2.2s both;
  }
  .typing-dot {
    width: 6px; height: 6px;
    background: var(--text-dim);
    border-radius: 50%;
    animation: typingPulse 1.4s infinite;
  }
  .typing-dot:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.2s; }
  .typing-dot:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 0.4s; }
  @keyframes typingPulse {
    0%, 100% { opacity: 0.3; transform: scale(0.8); }
    50% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }
  }

  /* ─── SECTION HELPERS ───────────────────────────── */
  .section-tag {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--blue-bright);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 44px);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #fff;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .section-body {
    font-size: 17px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    max-width: 600px;
    font-weight: 300;
  }
  .text-center { text-align: center; }
  .text-center .section-body { margin: 0 auto; }
  .divider {
    height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--card-border), transparent);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* ─── STATS BAR ─────────────────────────────────── */
  #stats {
    padding: 32px 0;
    background: var(--bg2);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--card-border);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--card-border);
  }
  .stats-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 64px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .stat-item { text-align: center; }
  .stat-num {
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--blue-bright);
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .stat-label { font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-dim); font-weight: 400; }

  /* ─── PROBLEM SECTION ───────────────────────────── */
  #problem { padding: 100px 0; }
  .problem-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 64px;
    align-items: start;
  }
  .problem-bullets { margin-top: 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; }
  .problem-bullet {
    display: flex;
    gap: 14px;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }
  .problem-bullet .icon {
    width: 36px; height: 36px;
    background: rgba(255,60,60,0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,60,60,0.2);
    border-radius: 8px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 16px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }
  .problem-bullet p { font-size: 15px; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 300; }
  .problem-bullet strong { color: var(--text); }
  .problem-visual {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 32px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .problem-visual::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0; right: 0;
    width: 200px; height: 200px;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse at top right, rgba(255,60,60,0.08), transparent 70%);
  }
  .call-missed {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
    padding: 16px;
    background: rgba(255,60,60,0.07);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,60,60,0.15);
    border-radius: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .call-missed .phone-icon {
    width: 42px; height: 42px;
    background: rgba(255,60,60,0.15);
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 20px;
  }
  .call-missed .call-info .name { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500; color: #fff; }
  .call-missed .call-info .detail { font-size: 13px; color: rgba(255,90,90,0.8); }
  .loss-card {
    background: rgba(255,60,60,0.06);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,60,60,0.12);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 20px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .loss-amount {
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
    font-size: 40px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #ff5a5a;
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .loss-label { font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-dim); }

  /* ─── HOW IT WORKS ──────────────────────────────── */
  #how { padding: 100px 0; background: var(--bg2); }
  .steps-track {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0;
    margin-top: 48px;
    position: relative;
  }
  .steps-track::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 27px;
    top: 40px;
    bottom: 40px;
    width: 2px;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--blue), rgba(45,126,248,0.1));
  }
  .step {
    display: flex;
    gap: 28px;
    padding: 24px 28px 24px 0;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateX(-20px);
    transition: opacity 0.5s ease, transform 0.5s ease;
  }
  .step.visible { opacity: 1; transform: translateX(0); }
  .step-num {
    width: 56px; height: 56px;
    background: var(--bg);
    border: 2px solid var(--blue);
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 18px;
    color: var(--blue-bright);
    flex-shrink: 0;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }
  .step-content { padding-top: 10px; }
  .step-content h3 { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .step-content p { font-size: 15px; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 300; }

  /* ─── DEMO TEXTS ────────────────────────────────── */
  #demo { padding: 100px 0; }
  .demo-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 64px;
    align-items: center;
    margin-top: 48px;
  }
  .demo-texts { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; }
  .demo-msg {
    padding: 16px 20px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    position: relative;
  }
  .demo-msg.out {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a4fa8, #2d7ef8);
    color: #fff;
    margin-left: 32px;
    border-bottom-right-radius: 4px;
  }
  .demo-msg.in {
    background: #1e2840;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-right: 32px;
    border-bottom-left-radius: 4px;
  }
  .demo-msg .msg-label {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    opacity: 0.6;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .demo-explain {
    margin-top: 24px;
    padding: 18px 20px;
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--blue);
    border-radius: 10px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  /* ─── ROI SECTION ───────────────────────────────── */
  #roi { padding: 100px 0; background: var(--bg2); }
  .roi-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 64px;
    align-items: start;
    margin-top: 48px;
  }
  .roi-example-card {
    background: var(--bg3);
    border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .roi-card-header {
    padding: 20px 24px;
    background: var(--blue-dim);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(45,126,248,0.15);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--blue-bright);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .roi-card-body { padding: 24px; }
  .roi-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 12px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--card-border);
    font-size: 15px;
  }
  .roi-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .roi-row .label { color: var(--text-muted); }
  .roi-row .value { font-weight: 600; color: #fff; }
  .roi-result {
    margin-top: 20px;
    padding: 20px 24px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(34,211,130,0.1), rgba(34,211,130,0.05));
    border: 1px solid rgba(34,211,130,0.2);
    border-radius: 10px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .roi-result-num {
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
    font-size: 42px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--green);
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .roi-result-label { font-size: 13px; color: rgba(34,211,130,0.7); }

  /* ─── ROI CALCULATOR ────────────────────────────── */
  .roi-calculator {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 28px;
  }
  .roi-calculator h3 {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #fff;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .calc-row { margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .calc-label {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .calc-label span { color: var(--blue-bright); font-weight: 600; }
  input[type=range] {
    width: 100%;
    -webkit-appearance: none;
    height: 4px;
    border-radius: 2px;
    background: var(--card-border);
    outline: none;
  }
  input[type=range]::-webkit-slider-thumb {
    -webkit-appearance: none;
    width: 18px; height: 18px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--blue);
    cursor: pointer;
    box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--blue-glow);
  }
  .calc-result {
    margin-top: 24px;
    padding: 20px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(45,126,248,0.12), rgba(45,126,248,0.06));
    border: 1px solid rgba(45,126,248,0.2);
    border-radius: 10px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .calc-result-num {
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
    font-size: 36px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--blue-bright);
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .calc-result-label { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-dim); }

  /* ─── FEATURES ──────────────────────────────────── */
  #features { padding: 100px 0; }
  .features-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 20px;
    margin-top: 48px;
  }
  .feature-card {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 28px;
    transition: border-color 0.2s, transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(20px);
    transition: opacity 0.5s ease, transform 0.5s ease, border-color 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
  }
  .feature-card.visible { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  .feature-card:hover {
    border-color: rgba(45,126,248,0.3);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(45,126,248,0.08);
    transform: translateY(-3px);
  }
  .feature-icon {
    width: 48px; height: 48px;
    background: var(--blue-dim);
    border: 1px solid rgba(45,126,248,0.2);
    border-radius: 12px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 22px;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  .feature-card h3 { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .feature-card p { font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.6; }

  /* ─── FOR WHO ────────────────────────────────────── */
  #forwho { padding: 100px 0; background: var(--bg2); }
  .forwho-inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 64px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .check-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; margin-top: 24px; }
  .check-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .check-item .ck {
    width: 24px; height: 24px;
    background: rgba(34,211,130,0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(34,211,130,0.25);
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: var(--green);
    font-size: 13px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .forwho-highlight {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 36px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .forwho-highlight::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0; right: 0;
    width: 180px; height: 180px;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse at top right, var(--blue-dim), transparent 70%);
  }
  .forwho-quote {
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    font-style: italic;
  }
  .forwho-quote strong { color: #fff; font-style: normal; }

  /* ─── DIFFERENTIATOR ─────────────────────────────── */
  #diff { padding: 100px 0; }
  .diff-inner { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; }
  .diff-pills {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-top: 32px;
  }
  .diff-pill {
    padding: 10px 18px;
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
    border-radius: 100px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    transition: border-color 0.2s, color 0.2s;
  }
  .diff-pill .pill-dot {
    width: 8px; height: 8px;
    background: var(--blue);
    border-radius: 50%;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .diff-pill:hover { border-color: rgba(45,126,248,0.35); color: var(--text); }

  /* ─── FAQ ────────────────────────────────────────── */
  #faq { padding: 100px 0; background: var(--bg2); }
  .faq-list {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 48px auto 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .faq-item {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: border-color 0.2s;
  }
  .faq-item.open { border-color: rgba(45,126,248,0.25); }
  .faq-q {
    padding: 20px 24px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    cursor: pointer;
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .faq-q span { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; color: #fff; }
  .faq-chevron {
    width: 24px; height: 24px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    transition: transform 0.3s;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    font-size: 18px;
  }
  .faq-item.open .faq-chevron { transform: rotate(180deg); color: var(--blue-bright); }
  .faq-a {
    max-height: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: max-height 0.35s ease, padding 0.35s ease;
  }
  .faq-a-inner {
    padding: 0 24px 20px;
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.65;
    font-weight: 300;
  }
  .faq-item.open .faq-a { max-height: 200px; }

  /* ─── FINAL CTA / FORM ───────────────────────────── */
  #cta { padding: 100px 0; }
  .cta-glow {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -100px; left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 700px; height: 400px;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, rgba(45,126,248,0.12), transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .cta-inner {
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .cta-inner .section-title { font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 42px); }
  .cta-inner .section-body { margin: 0 auto 40px; }
  .form-card {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 36px;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .form-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px; }
  .form-group { margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .form-group label {
    display: block;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 7px;
  }
  .form-group input, .form-group select {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
    border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    color: var(--text);
    font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 15px;
    outline: none;
    transition: border-color 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
  }
  .form-group input::placeholder { color: var(--text-dim); }
  .form-group input:focus, .form-group select:focus {
    border-color: var(--blue);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(45,126,248,0.12);
  }
  .form-group select { -webkit-appearance: none; cursor: pointer; }
  .form-submit {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 16px;
    background: var(--blue);
    color: #fff;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 10px;
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 700;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s;
    margin-top: 8px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px var(--blue-glow);
  }
  .form-submit:hover {
    background: var(--blue-bright);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 30px rgba(74,158,255,0.4);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }
  .form-success {
    display: none;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 40px 20px;
  }
  .form-success .success-icon {
    width: 64px; height: 64px;
    background: rgba(34,211,130,0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(34,211,130,0.3);
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 28px;
    margin: 0 auto 16px;
  }
  .form-success h3 { font-size: 22px; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .form-success p { font-size: 15px; color: var(--text-muted); }
  .form-privacy {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    margin-top: 16px;
  }

  /* ─── FOOTER ────────────────────────────────────── */
  footer {
    padding: 32px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--card-border);
    text-align: center;
  }
  footer p { font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-dim); }

  /* ─── STICKY CTA ────────────────────────────────── */
  .sticky-cta {
    position: fixed;
    bottom: 24px;
    right: 24px;
    z-index: 99;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(20px);
    transition: opacity 0.3s, transform 0.3s;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .sticky-cta.visible {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0);
    pointer-events: all;
  }

  /* ─── FADE-IN ANIMATION ──────────────────────────── */
  .fade-in {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(24px);
    transition: opacity 0.6s ease, transform 0.6s ease;
  }
  .fade-in.visible { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }

  /* ─── RESPONSIVE ────────────────────────────────── */
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .hero-grid, .problem-grid, .demo-grid, .roi-grid, .forwho-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 40px; }
    .features-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    .form-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .nav-links { display: none; }
    .hamburger { display: flex; }
    .phone-wrap { order: -1; }
    .problem-visual { order: -1; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .features-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .stats-row { gap: 32px; }
    .btn-large { width: 100%; justify-content: center; }
    .hero-btns { flex-direction: column; }
    .form-card { padding: 24px 20px; }
  }

  /* ─── MOBILE MENU ───────────────────────────────── */
  .mobile-menu {
    display: none;
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    background: rgba(8,12,20,0.97);
    backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
    z-index: 99;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 32px;
  }
  .mobile-menu.open { display: flex; }
  .mobile-menu a {
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }
  .mobile-menu a:hover { color: var(--text); }
  .mobile-close {
    position: absolute;
    top: 24px; right: 24px;
    font-size: 24px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    cursor: pointer;
    background: none;
    border: none;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- STICKY CTA -->
<div class="sticky-cta" id="stickyCta">
  <a href="#cta" class="btn btn-primary" style="box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(45,126,248,0.4);">
    Get Started →
  </a>
</div>

<!-- MOBILE MENU -->
<div class="mobile-menu" id="mobileMenu">
  <button class="mobile-close" onclick="closeMobile()">✕</button>
  <a href="#how" onclick="closeMobile()">How It Works</a>
  <a href="#features" onclick="closeMobile()">Features</a>
  <a href="#roi" onclick="closeMobile()">ROI</a>
  <a href="#faq" onclick="closeMobile()">FAQ</a>
  <a href="#cta" class="btn btn-primary btn-large" onclick="closeMobile()">Get Started</a>
</div>

<!-- NAV -->
<nav id="navbar">
  <div class="nav-inner">
    <div class="nav-logo">
      <div class="dot"></div>
      Missed Call Rescue
    </div>
    <ul class="nav-links">
      <li><a href="#how">How It Works</a></li>
      <li><a href="#features">Features</a></li>
      <li><a href="#roi">ROI</a></li>
      <li><a href="#faq">FAQ</a></li>
    </ul>
    <a href="#cta" class="btn btn-primary" style="font-size:14px">Get Started</a>
    <div class="hamburger" onclick="openMobile()">
      <span></span><span></span><span></span>
    </div>
  </div>
</nav>

<!-- HERO -->
<section id="hero">
  <div class="hero-glow"></div>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="hero-grid">
      <div>
        <div class="hero-badge">
          <div class="live-dot"></div>
          Built for Car Detailing Businesses
        </div>
        <h1>Stop Losing Car Detailing Customers When You <span>Miss Calls</span></h1>
        <p class="hero-sub">When a lead calls and nobody answers, they usually call the next detailer. Missed Call Rescue instantly texts them back, follows up automatically, and helps you recover lost jobs before they disappear.</p>
        <div class="hero-btns">
          <a href="#cta" class="btn btn-primary btn-large">Get This Set Up For My Business</a>
          <a href="#how" class="btn btn-ghost btn-large">See How It Works</a>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-bullets">
          <div class="hero-bullet"><div class="check">✓</div>Instant missed-call text back</div>
          <div class="hero-bullet"><div class="check">✓</div>Automatic follow-up texts</div>
          <div class="hero-bullet"><div class="check">✓</div>Lead notifications sent to you fast</div>
          <div class="hero-bullet"><div class="check">✓</div>Missed-call tracking and lost revenue estimates</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="phone-wrap">
        <div class="phone-glow-bg"></div>
        <div class="phone">
          <div class="phone-notch"></div>
          <div class="phone-header">
            <div class="phone-contact">MC</div>
            <div class="phone-name">Missed Customer</div>
            <div class="phone-status">Text Message</div>
          </div>
          <div class="messages">
            <div class="msg msg-in">📵 Missed call at 2:14 PM</div>
            <div class="msg msg-out">Hey, sorry we missed your call! What kind of detailing service are you looking for? 🚗</div>
            <div class="msg msg-in">Hi! I was looking for a full interior detail. How much do you charge?</div>
            <div class="msg msg-out">We'd love to help with that. Our interior details start at $180. Want to book this week?</div>
            <div class="msg msg-in">Yes, that works! What times do you have?</div>
            <div class="typing-indicator">
              <div class="typing-dot"></div>
              <div class="typing-dot"></div>
              <div class="typing-dot"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- STATS BAR -->
<div id="stats">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="stats-row">
      <div class="stat-item">
        <div class="stat-num">78%</div>
        <div class="stat-label">of callers don't leave a voicemail</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-item">
        <div class="stat-num">&lt;5 min</div>
        <div class="stat-label">average response time</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-item">
        <div class="stat-num">3×</div>
        <div class="stat-label">more likely to convert with fast follow-up</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-item">
        <div class="stat-num">$0</div>
        <div class="stat-label">tech setup needed from you</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- PROBLEM SECTION -->
<section id="problem">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="problem-grid">
      <div>
        <span class="section-tag">The Problem</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">Missed Calls Are Lost Jobs</h2>
        <p class="section-body">Most car detailing businesses are busy working, driving, cleaning cars, or talking to current customers. That means missed calls happen all the time.</p>
        <p class="section-body" style="margin-top:14px">If a customer calls and doesn't get an answer, they usually don't wait. They call the next detailer. That means you can lose jobs without even realizing it.</p>
        <div class="problem-bullets">
          <div class="problem-bullet">
            <div class="icon">📵</div>
            <p><strong>Missed calls often turn into missed bookings</strong> — the lead is warm right now, not tomorrow.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="problem-bullet">
            <div class="icon">⏱️</div>
            <p><strong>Slow follow-up kills good leads</strong> — most customers make a decision within minutes.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="problem-bullet">
            <div class="icon">🏃</div>
            <p><strong>Most customers move on fast</strong> — your competitor is one search result away.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="problem-bullet">
            <div class="icon">💸</div>
            <p><strong>You may be losing money every week</strong> without even knowing it's happening.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="problem-visual fade-in">
        <div class="call-missed">
          <div class="phone-icon">📵</div>
          <div class="call-info">
            <div class="name">Unknown Caller</div>
            <div class="detail">Missed call · No callback · Lead gone</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="call-missed">
          <div class="phone-icon">📵</div>
          <div class="call-info">
            <div class="name">Local Number</div>
            <div class="detail">Missed call · No text back · Booked competitor</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="call-missed">
          <div class="phone-icon">📵</div>
          <div class="call-info">
            <div class="name">Mobile Number</div>
            <div class="detail">Missed call · Went to voicemail · No response</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="loss-card" style="margin-top:20px">
          <div class="loss-amount">-$450</div>
          <div class="loss-label">estimated lost this week from 3 missed calls</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="divider"></div>

<!-- HOW IT WORKS -->
<section id="how">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="text-center fade-in">
      <span class="section-tag">Simple Process</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">How It Works</h2>
      <p class="section-body">Five steps. Fully automatic. You just get the lead.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="steps-track">
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num">1</div>
        <div class="step-content">
          <h3>A customer calls your business</h3>
          <p>They're ready to ask about a detail, pricing, availability, or booking. The intent is high.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num">2</div>
        <div class="step-content">
          <h3>You miss the call</h3>
          <p>Maybe you're working, driving, or just can't get to the phone in time. It happens — a lot.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num">3</div>
        <div class="step-content">
          <h3>We instantly text them back</h3>
          <p>Within seconds, they receive a text from your business. They know you're responsive. They stay engaged.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num">4</div>
        <div class="step-content">
          <h3>We automatically follow up</h3>
          <p>If they don't reply, we send a follow-up text so the lead doesn't go cold and you stay top of mind.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num">5</div>
        <div class="step-content">
          <h3>You get the lead details</h3>
          <p>You get notified fast with the customer's info so you can jump in and close the job.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="divider"></div>

<!-- DEMO TEXT SECTION -->
<section id="demo">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="text-center fade-in">
      <span class="section-tag">See It In Action</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">What Your Leads See</h2>
      <p class="section-body">Automatic, professional, and friendly. Sent within seconds of a missed call.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="demo-grid">
      <div class="demo-texts fade-in">
        <div class="demo-msg out">
          <span class="msg-label">Instant text · sent in seconds</span>
          Hey, sorry we missed your call! What kind of detailing service are you looking for? 🚗
        </div>
        <div style="font-size:12px; color:var(--text-dim); text-align:center; padding: 4px 0;">
          — if no response after a few hours —
        </div>
        <div class="demo-msg out">
          <span class="msg-label">Automatic follow-up</span>
          Just checking in — are you still looking to book a detail? We have spots available this week.
        </div>
        <div class="demo-msg in">
          <span class="msg-label">Customer replies</span>
          Yes, I'm still interested! Can I get a full exterior detail Saturday morning?
        </div>
        <div class="demo-msg out">
          <span class="msg-label">Conversion</span>
          Perfect, we'll have the team reach out shortly to confirm your Saturday booking! 🙌
        </div>
        <div class="demo-explain">
          ⚡ This keeps your business responsive even when you can't answer — so leads never feel ignored and customers don't drift to the competition.
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="fade-in" style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:20px; justify-content:center;">
        <div style="background:var(--card); border:1px solid var(--card-border); border-radius:var(--radius); padding:28px;">
          <div style="font-size:40px; margin-bottom:12px;">⚡</div>
          <h3 style="font-size:18px; font-weight:700; color:#fff; margin-bottom:8px;">Instant Response</h3>
          <p style="font-size:14px; color:var(--text-muted); font-weight:300;">Texts go out in seconds — before the customer has time to call someone else.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="background:var(--card); border:1px solid var(--card-border); border-radius:var(--radius); padding:28px;">
          <div style="font-size:40px; margin-bottom:12px;">🔁</div>
          <h3 style="font-size:18px; font-weight:700; color:#fff; margin-bottom:8px;">Smart Follow-Up</h3>
          <p style="font-size:14px; color:var(--text-muted); font-weight:300;">If they don't respond, we follow up again automatically so no lead slips through the cracks.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="background:var(--card); border:1px solid var(--card-border); border-radius:var(--radius); padding:28px;">
          <div style="font-size:40px; margin-bottom:12px;">🔔</div>
          <h3 style="font-size:18px; font-weight:700; color:#fff; margin-bottom:8px;">You Stay in Control</h3>
          <p style="font-size:14px; color:var(--text-muted); font-weight:300;">You get notified the moment a lead responds so you can jump in and close it personally.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="divider"></div>

<!-- ROI SECTION -->
<section id="roi">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="text-center fade-in">
      <span class="section-tag">The Math</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">How Much Are Missed Calls Costing You?</h2>
      <p class="section-body">Most business owners don't realize how much money slips away. If your average job is worth $150–$300+, even a few missed leads add up fast.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="roi-grid">
      <div class="fade-in">
        <div class="roi-example-card">
          <div class="roi-card-header">📊 Example Scenario</div>
          <div class="roi-card-body">
            <div class="roi-row">
              <span class="label">Missed calls per week</span>
              <span class="value">10</span>
            </div>
            <div class="roi-row">
              <span class="label">Recovery rate (conservative)</span>
              <span class="value">30%</span>
            </div>
            <div class="roi-row">
              <span class="label">Recovered jobs</span>
              <span class="value">3</span>
            </div>
            <div class="roi-row">
              <span class="label">Average job value</span>
              <span class="value">$200</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="roi-result" style="margin-top:16px;">
          <div class="roi-result-num">$600/wk</div>
          <div class="roi-result-label">recovered revenue from just a few saved leads</div>
        </div>
        <p style="font-size:14px; color:var(--text-dim); margin-top:16px; line-height:1.6;">
          Missed Call Rescue helps you recover leads automatically and shows you the value of every call you might have lost.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="roi-calculator fade-in">
        <h3>🔢 Calculate Your Own ROI</h3>
        <div class="calc-row">
          <div class="calc-label">Missed calls per week <span id="callsVal">8</span></div>
          <input type="range" min="1" max="50" value="8" id="callsSlider">
        </div>
        <div class="calc-row">
          <div class="calc-label">Average job value <span id="jobVal">$175</span></div>
          <input type="range" min="50" max="600" value="175" step="25" id="jobSlider">
        </div>
        <div class="calc-row">
          <div class="calc-label">Recovery rate <span id="rateVal">30%</span></div>
          <input type="range" min="10" max="60" value="30" step="5" id="rateSlider">
        </div>
        <div class="calc-result">
          <div class="calc-result-num" id="calcResult">$420</div>
          <div class="calc-result-label">estimated recovered revenue per week</div>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:12px; font-size:13px; color:var(--text-dim);">
          <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; padding: 6px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--card-border);">
            <span>Per month</span><span id="calcMonth" style="color:var(--text-muted); font-weight:500;">$1,680</span>
          </div>
          <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; padding: 6px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--card-border);">
            <span>Per year</span><span id="calcYear" style="color:var(--text-muted); font-weight:500;">$21,840</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <a href="#cta" class="btn btn-primary" style="width:100%; justify-content:center; margin-top:20px;">
          Recover These Leads →
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

