        </div>
        <div class="faq-a">
          <div class="faq-a-inner">
            The moment a call goes unanswered, the system automatically sends a professional text to that number on your behalf. It happens within seconds — before the customer has time to call someone else. They feel acknowledged, and your business looks responsive even when you're slammed.
